<Layout
  title="About Alpenglow Crafting Co."
  description="The story behind Alpenglow Crafting Company."
  pubDate={new Date('August 02 2026')}
>
  <p>
    If you've ever stood at the base of a mountain just as the sun drops below the horizon, you've seen it: that brief, magical moment when the snow-capped peaks illuminate in shades of rosy pink, warm gold, and vibrant violet. 
  </p>
  <p>
    That phenomenon is called <strong>Alpenglow</strong>.
  </p>
  <p>
    We founded <strong>Alpenglow Crafting Company</strong> around that exact feeling—bringing warmth, vibrant color, and handcrafted beauty into everyday items. Whether it’s a custom embroidered monogram, a handmade tote bag, or a specialized fabric project, every piece is stitched with care, precision, and passion.
  </p>

  <h3>Our Craft & Equipment</h3>
  <p>
    Equipped with professional sewing and embroidery tools, we work closely with clients to transform custom ideas into tangible, beautiful keepsakes. From personal gifts to custom branded goods, we take pride in clean stitchwork and durable materials.
  </p>

  <h3>Have a Custom Idea?</h3>
  <p>
    We love collaborate on unique projects! Head over to our <a href="/contact">Order Request page</a> to share your ideas, dimensions, or fabric preferences, and let's create something beautiful together.
  </p>
</Layout>